MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Misho's yes on the exact text, 12 Oct ~06:45 UTC, in his own chat.
Restores 0148c6a (§110.6) and b986aea (§111.2), reverted in 5039abb after
box 52938 („works in customs"), with what was missing:
- the row's found_by_their_own_work carries the approved sentence
  (FOUND_BY_OWN_WORK_NOTE), MODEL-FACING, D44;
- such a row carries no employer or jobPosition to repeat;
- the own-work branch is read only by search_by_tag's main search, where
  the row can carry the sentence; the list search and the name search
  no longer see it (they would have had no sentence).
Undo: revert this commit.

